#: ../../cluster.rst:521
msgid ""
"Explain why a torn, copied or foreign slot can cost a hint and never "
"choose a server that may not serve, why the path never names a half-made "
"file, and why the sketch may overestimate a frequency but never "
"underestimate it."
msgstr ""
