msgstr "تمرين 9.6"

#: ../../cluster.rst:545
msgid ""
"Two operators run ``diff`` against head 7 and then ``apply`` at the same "
"moment, one adding a server and one removing a frontend. What does each "
"see, what does the database hold afterwards, and what should the second "
"operator do? Why would an ``apply`` conditioned on the head at the time "
